      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Adam Smith is known as the 'Father of Economics' and published 'The Wealth of Nations' in 1776.",
        "Factor returns must be matched correctly for exams: Land earns Rent, Labour earns Wages, Capital earns Interest, and Entrepreneurship earns Profit.",
